   "gap_before": 0.55,
   "event": "ordinary_request",
   "block": "weather_plans.ctx12"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Nice idea. Check the forecast each morning and pick a town with a castle or a park, so it's worth the drive.",
   "est_sec": 6.92,
   "gap_before": 0.7,
   "role": "followup",
   "block": "weather_plans.ctx12"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Can I ask about something else? I share a bedroom with my little brother and it's impossible to study.",
   "est_sec": 5.99,
   "gap_before": 0.99,
   "block": "studying.dlg30",
   "event": "ordinary_request"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "That's tough. Is there anywhere else in the house you could use, even for an hour?",
   "est_sec": 5.06,
   "gap_before": 1.11,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "studying.dlg30"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "The kitchen, but my mum cooks there.",
